{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_202_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_202","textTraditional":"一、二十有二年。春，齊侯伐莒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_202_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_202","textTraditional":"二、宋華亥、向甯、華定自宋南里出奔楚。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_202_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_202","textTraditional":"三、大蒐于昌姦。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_202_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_202","textTraditional":"四、夏四月乙丑，天王崩。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_202_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_202","textTraditional":"五、六月，叔鞅如京師。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_202_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_202","textTraditional":"六、葬景王。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_202_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_202","textTraditional":"七、王室亂。劉子、單子以王猛居于皇。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_202_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_202","textTraditional":"何言乎王室亂？言不及外也。劉子、單子以王猛居于皇。其稱王猛何？當國也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_202_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_202","textTraditional":"八、秋，劉子、單子以王猛入于王城。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_202_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_202","textTraditional":"王城者何？西周也。其言入何？篡辭也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_202_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_202","textTraditional":"九、冬十月，王子猛卒。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_202_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_202","textTraditional":"此未踰年之君也，其稱王子猛卒何？不與當也。不與當者，不與當父死子繼、兄死弟及之辭也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_202_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_202","textTraditional":"十、十有二月癸酉朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}